      "alt": "Into the Woods",
      "description": "That's what Little Red, a Witch, Cinderella, the Baker, and his wife discover as they invade one another's stories and find themselves tangled in a web of unexpected consequences. They quickly find this web is too big to untangle on their own and that they must work together to set everything right in the kingdom. Into the Woods reminds us that only together can we defeat the wolves and giants of the world​. With a stunning, unforgettable score featuring \"No One is Alone,\" \"Children Will Listen,\" and \"Giants in the Sky,\" this iconic show will enchant, entrance, and delight!",
